{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "title": "Carreiras Match - Crescimento & Funil",
  "uid": "carreiras-growth-funnel",
  "tags": [
    "carreiras-match",
    "negócio",
    "crescimento"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "period",
        "label": "Janela",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "24h,7d,30d",
        "current": {
          "text": "30d",
          "value": "30d"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "24h",
            "value": "24h",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "7d",
            "value": "7d",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "30d",
            "value": "30d",
            "selected": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### O que este painel mostra\nFoco em crescimento: quantas pessoas chegam, quantas viram usuário, e quantas usam o produto de verdade (currículo, análise). O seletor **Janela** no topo troca o período (24h / 7 dias / 30 dias) de todos os painéis marcados com `$period`. Use para responder: 'estamos crescendo?' e 'onde as pessoas desistem?'"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Aquisição e ativação — $period",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Visualizações",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_created{entity=\"page_views\",period=\"$period\"}",
          "legendFormat": "views"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Novos leads",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_created{entity=\"leads\",period=\"$period\"}",
          "legendFormat": "leads"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Novos usuários",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_created{entity=\"users\",period=\"$period\"}",
          "legendFormat": "usuários"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Novos currículos",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_created{entity=\"resumes\",period=\"$period\"}",
          "legendFormat": "currículos"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Novas análises",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_created{entity=\"analyses\",period=\"$period\"}",
          "legendFormat": "análises"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Análises por novo usuário",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 5
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 2
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_created{entity=\"analyses\",period=\"$period\"} / clamp_min(carreiras_business_created{entity=\"users\",period=\"$period\"}, 1)",
          "legendFormat": "ativação"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Quantas análises, em média, cada pessoa nova faz — indica se o produto está sendo realmente usado logo no início (ativação)."
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Conversões acumuladas",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Funil principal",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "showUnfilled": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_total{entity=\"leads\"}",
          "legendFormat": "1. Leads"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_total{entity=\"users\"}",
          "legendFormat": "2. Usuários"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_total{entity=\"resumes\"}",
          "legendFormat": "3. Currículos"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_total{entity=\"analyses\"}",
          "legendFormat": "4. Análises"
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_breakdown{metric=\"subscription_status\",value=\"active\"}",
          "legendFormat": "5. Assinaturas"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Do primeiro contato até virar assinante — números totais acumulados (não é só do período selecionado)."
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Taxas de conversão",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 11
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.1
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.3
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "showUnfilled": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_total{entity=\"users\"} / clamp_min(carreiras_business_total{entity=\"leads\"}, 1)",
          "legendFormat": "Lead → usuário"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_total{entity=\"resumes\"} / clamp_min(carreiras_business_total{entity=\"users\"}, 1)",
          "legendFormat": "Usuário → currículo"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_total{entity=\"analyses\"} / clamp_min(carreiras_business_total{entity=\"resumes\"}, 1)",
          "legendFormat": "Currículo → análise"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_breakdown{metric=\"subscription_status\",value=\"active\"} / clamp_min(carreiras_business_total{entity=\"users\"}, 1)",
          "legendFormat": "Usuário → assinatura"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Percentual de gente que avança de uma etapa para a próxima. Verde = etapa saudável, vermelho = ponto de atenção."
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Tendência e engajamento",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 20
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Evolução móvel",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 21
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 15
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_created{entity=\"page_views\",period=\"$period\"}",
          "legendFormat": "visualizações"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_created{entity=\"users\",period=\"$period\"}",
          "legendFormat": "usuários"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_created{entity=\"analyses\",period=\"$period\"}",
          "legendFormat": "análises"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Uso por usuário",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 21
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 2,
          "min": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "showUnfilled": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_total{entity=\"resumes\"} / clamp_min(carreiras_business_total{entity=\"users\"}, 1)",
          "legendFormat": "currículos/usuário"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_total{entity=\"analyses\"} / clamp_min(carreiras_business_total{entity=\"users\"}, 1)",
          "legendFormat": "análises/usuário"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_total{entity=\"applications\"} / clamp_min(carreiras_business_total{entity=\"users\"}, 1)",
          "legendFormat": "candidaturas/usuário"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Média de uso por usuário cadastrado (histórico total, não só do período) — mostra engajamento contínuo."
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Grátis vs. pago — onde o funil trava",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Limite de análise grátis atingido",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 31
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 15
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(carreiras_free_analysis_limit_hit_total[1h])) by (reason)",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Quantas vezes por hora um usuário sem assinatura bateu no limite de análises grátis (diário=3, mensal=10). Se isso ficar sempre perto de zero, o limite não é o gargalo da conversão ainda."
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Trials das ferramentas com cadastro (accountFree)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 31
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 15
          }
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase(carreiras_free_tool_trial_total[1h])) by (tool, outcome)",
          "legendFormat": "{{tool}} · {{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "outcome=granted: 1ª vez usando a ferramenta. already_used: usuário voltou e bateu no limite de 1 uso grátis — sinal de demanda represada, candidato natural a virar assinante. subscriber: já era assinante."
    },
    {
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Adoção acumulada por ferramenta grátis",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 31
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "min": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "gradient",
        "showUnfilled": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "carreiras_business_breakdown{metric=\"free_tool_usage\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{value}}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
